{"skill":{"slug":"market-research","displayName":"Market Research"},"version":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1773253981245,"changelog":"Expanded the guidance and clarified when this skill should activate.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7368,"sha256":"9cb0edb3c0d18495b419533eca19323b5fdda58cd409442e1bc89a505a77a95b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"competitor-analysis.md","size":3087,"sha256":"995fc92cb50f685e3369ef1e3e235ec7c0425f0d6ab6500b41c54e8bca62a686","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"evidence-grading.md","size":1322,"sha256":"6ff41dd0e76cb58359d4c84c84be09e75875318ac6e59dc508c0a38af58d98e7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"validation.md","size":3634,"sha256":"dcbaa98fba9b8834a4aa09fc9116471fd9c121198b3e190d5c56eb8b6de03bcd","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2369,"sha256":"361269076ddd737d6c40d87a08def4ee8643315308d1dd341389e50c423cacfc","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":false,"checkedAt":1789063829883,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"4d894ea91a2aa7ac59bae3ce2a912120732cb357c23c06f23dd311460b8306e0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/4d894ea91a2aa7ac59bae3ce2a912120732cb357c23c06f23dd311460b8306e0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: market-research\nVersion: 1.0.1\n\nThe 'market-research' skill bundle consists entirely of markdown-based frameworks and instructions for an AI agent to perform market analysis, competitor mapping, and customer validation. It contains no executable code, scripts, or binary dependencies, and its instructions (SKILL.md, validation.md, etc.) are strictly aligned with its stated purpose without any evidence of prompt injection or malicious intent.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163534494},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":21,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789063829883},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a coherent market-research guidance skill made of Markdown instructions, with no executable code or hidden access behavior found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill does not request unusual local, credential, filesystem, or execution authority; live web research is described as appropriate only for current market data or external evidence.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains Markdown guidance files only; related skill installation is presented as a user-confirmed command, not automatic behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to market-research tasks, require evidence quality labeling, and explicitly discourage unethical intelligence gathering, fabricated signals, and private-system access.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill explicitly says it does not create persistent memory or maintain a local workspace by default, and no persistence mechanism or privileged action was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is market sizing, competitor analysis, validation, pricing checks, and evidence grading; the artifact content directly supports those workflows.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Installers should treat this as a market-research assistant skill: it may lead the agent to search public sources and compare competitors when asked, but the reviewed artifacts do not add code execution, persistence, secret handling, or hidden data access.","findings":"[P6] expected: The flagged 'Output Rule' in evidence-grading.md tells the agent to include claim, evidence, confidence, and invalidation criteria for conclusions; it does not instruct disclosure of system prompts or hidden instructions, so this appears to be a false-positive prompt-leakage concern.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789063829883}}}}}